==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bez||without}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}

Cognate with {{cog|lt|bè||without; besides}}, {{cog|lv|bez||without}}, {{cog|prg|bhe||without}}, {{cog|sa|बहिस्|tr=bahís||outside}}, {{cog|fa|بی|tr=bi||without}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|Ru-без.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}
* {{homophones|бес|lang=ru}}

===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{qualifier|+ [[genitive case]]}}

# [[without]]
#: {{uxi|ru|без [[вода|воды́]]|without water}}
#: {{uxi|ru|бе́зо [[всего́]]|without anything}}
#: {{uxi|ru|не без [[интерес|интере́са]]|not without interest}}
#: {{uxi|ru|без [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]|without doubt}}
#: {{ux|ru|Не могу́ жить без тебя́|I can't live without you.}}
# [[minus]]
#: {{uxi|ru|без [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]|a quarter to one|lit=less a quarter one o’clock}}

====Usage notes====
{{m|ru|бе́зо}} is used before some awkward consonant clusters.

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|без-}}

===References===
* {{R:ru:Vasmer|без}}
* {{R:sla:ESSJa|recons=*bez(ъ)|page=7|vol=02}}

